From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:39:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom,sm8250: Add SM6450 sound card
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add the sound card of SM6450 boards. It falls back to SM8450's, as the
other AudioReach cards of that family do.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
index b49a920af..7d2ba2a4d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
           - const: qcom,sdm845-sndcard
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - qcom,sm6450-sndcard
               - qcom,sm8550-sndcard
               - qcom,sm8650-sndcard
               - qcom,sm8750-sndcard
